# Stocking the Pantry: "{2}, Remove a supply counter from this enchantment: Draw a card." Bot1's Honor on its own Ornithopter
# gives it a supply counter (Honor draws a card too: the hand is counted after it). With one mana in the pool the ability is not
# offered (only the Forest to pay with); with two it draws exactly one card, spends exactly {2} and removes the counter, and with no counter left it is not
# offered even with mana to spare.

